, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. January to February, February to March and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 34 of those years. In 2026 so far, March to April sat at 58% of normal on the middle and February to March at 60%. Grid 19987 had its driest year in 2007 at 68% of normal.</p>"}
